# Game_BombSquad — Bomb Timing Game (ID 8)
# Files: src/coordinator/Game_BombSquad.h, Game_BombSquad.cpp
# HTML: data/game_bomb_setup.html, game_bomb_names.html, game_bomb_run.html

## GAMEPLAY
Reaction timing: press button at exactly the target time (blind flight).
Players shown target seconds, then must estimate when that time elapses.
Ranked by accuracy. Multiple rounds.

## CONFIG
- activePucks (1-12), maxSeconds, maxRounds
- difficulty: 0=750ms tolerance, 1=500ms, 2=250ms
- groupMode: true=all same target, false=individual random targets (3-maxSeconds)

## STATES
BOMB_SETUP → BOMB_INFO (blink target count) → BOMB_COUNTDOWN (3.1s, SKI) → BOMB_RUNNING → BOMB_FINISHED

## KEY MECHANICS
- INFO phase: pucks blink rapidly showing target seconds
- Running: blind flight, timeout = maxTargetTime*1000 + 5000ms
- Press: delta = (pressTime - gameStartTime) - (targetTime * 1000)
- Within tolerance: RAINBOW + DINGDONG, score++
- Outside tolerance: FAIL (red) + EXPLOSION
- Timeout: auto-EXPLODED with delta=99999
- evaluateRound(): check all acted or timeout

## COMMANDS
setup, cfg_pucks, cfg_time, cfg_diff, cfg_rounds, cfg_group, start, stop, reset, exit

## STATUS JSON
{state, round, max, target, time, players: [{score, res (NONE/DEFUSED/EXPLODED), last (delta), avg, target}]}
